OL,3,GNEWSAA11 reopens early after bridge
OL,4,Asuccessfully installed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major road has reopened a day earlier
OL,7,Fthan expected after engineers installed
OL,8,Fa new bridge ahead of schedule.
OL,10,FThe A11 near Norwich was shut on Friday
OL,11,Fand had been due to remain closed in
OL,12,Fboth directions until Monday morning
OL,13,Fbetween the A11/A47 Thickthorn
OL,14,Fjunction, and Wymondham, while the
OL,15,Fmodular bridge was built across it.
OL,17,FThe bridge is part of the Thickthorn
OL,18,Fjunction project, which began about 18
OL,19,Fmonths ago, and aims to reduce
OL,20,Fcongestion by removing around 12,000
OL,21,Fvehicles from the roundabout each day.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
